    "title": "Lightsaber & Gun Simulator",
    "description": "Ready to drown in the gun sound effects and pranks on your friends with gun sound and lightsabers? Try the amazing Taser Gun & Lightsaber app: Gun Simulator & Lightsaber.\r\n\r\n\u26a1Lightsaber & Gun Simulator Prank\u26a1 contains all handles and gun modes you wish to own as a science fiction addict. You can experience a realistic lightsaber and gun effect shotgun, and taser gun, in which you will be amazed by the stunning colors, colorful visuals & shocking sound effects.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5How to play\ud83d\udca5\r\n\u26a1 Select a weapon on the Home screen\r\n\u26a1 Tap on your screen for gunshots sound & animator\r\n\u26a1 Select fire mode: Single, Burst Mode, Auto (Hold) or Shake\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5Features\ud83d\udca5\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Lightsaber & shotgun sound effects: provide various gun skins and gunshot sounds\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Simulate realistic machine guns: AK47, M4A1, Barrett M99, COLT M1911, FAMAS, Barrett M82, Steyr Scout...\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Experience unlimited sound effects\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Realistic light saber with awesome skins\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Taser Gun: Stunning graphics to simulate an electric gun\r\n\ud83d\udd2b SINGLE and AUTO Gunshots\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Exciting gun sounds gameplay sound of gun\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Great choice for a Gun pranks simulator when you are with friends\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0fPlease note: Lightsaber & Gun Simulator includes realistic weapons' sound and visual effects, BUT it's just a prank app, NOT a real dangerous weapon and can not cause damage and harm anyone.\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload & Enjoy the simulation of Lightsaber & gun shot sound effects and taser gun to become a real space soldier!",
